/* Get Started Button */
#get-started-btn {
    background-color: #68a5ad;
    color: white;
    padding: 20px 50px;
    font-size: 20px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: 'Minecraft', sans-serif;
    transition: background-color 0.3s;
}

#get-started-btn:hover {
    background-color: #44b1a1;
}
3. JavaScript Functionality:
This is where you define what happens when the "Get Started" button is clicked. Typically, you might want to hide the landing page and display the game. Here's how to do that:

